1
00:00:00,490 --> 00:00:03,430
(Sheldon:)Have you developed any
of the following symptoms?

2
00:00:03,660 --> 00:00:10,030
(Sheldon:)A growing nose or perhaps a warm sensation
in the trouser region?

3
00:00:10,701 --> 00:00:14,531
(Sheldon:)Also known as full-blown
Liar, Liar, Pants on Fire.

4
00:00:15,205 --> 00:00:18,575
(Amy:)All right, all right.
But I really was sick at the beginning.

5
00:00:18,809 --> 00:00:21,939
(Amy:)It's just been so nice
having you take care of me.

6
00:00:23,547 --> 00:00:26,017
(Sheldon:)It hurts that you would lie to me, Amy.

7
00:00:26,216 --> 00:00:28,876
(Sheldon:)I thought our relationship
was based on trust...

8
00:00:29,086 --> 00:00:33,116
(Sheldon:)...and a mutual admiration
that skews in my favor.

9
00:00:33,924 --> 00:00:35,514
(Amy:)I feel terrible I did this.

10
00:00:35,726 --> 00:00:39,886
(Sheldon:)It pains me to say it,
but I think some form of penalty is in order...

11
00:00:40,097 --> 00:00:43,467
...so as to discourage this type of behavior
in the future.

12
00:00:43,700 --> 00:00:46,460
(Amy:)I suppose that's fair. What do you suggest?

13
00:00:46,703 --> 00:00:50,863
(Sheldon:)In a perfect world, I'd lock you in a stockade
in the public square.

14
00:00:51,475 --> 00:00:54,035
And that probably requires a permit.

15
00:00:56,580 --> 00:01:00,380
(Amy:)I could not be allowed to go to the opening
of the next Star Trek movie.

